.com/vi/EwistIvUw4M/sddefault.jpg", "height": 480, "width": 640, "preference": -5, "id": "36", "resolution": "640x480"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/EwistIvUw4M/sddefault.webp", "preference": -4, "id": "37"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EwistIvUw4M/hq720.jpg", "preference": -3, "id": "38"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/EwistIvUw4M/hq720.webp", "preference": -2, "id": "39"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EwistIvUw4M/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": -1, "id": "40", "resolution": "1920x1080"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/EwistIvUw4M/maxresdefault.webp", "preference": 0, "id": "41"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/EwistIvUw4M/maxresdefault.jpg", "description": "Welcome to HM Vlogs UAE!\n\nIn this fourth part of my Bandarban travel series, I’m taking you to one of the most famous and breathtaking mountains in Bandarban—Chimbuk Pahar. Known for its mesmerizing beauty, this spot attracts countless visitors who come to witness the stunning landscapes and cloud-covered hills.\n\nSome travelers choose to camp overnight, while others prefer to stay in resorts. I stayed at Chimbuk Hill Resort, a wonderful place to experience the natural beauty of Bandarban. Most of my time was spent on the rooftop, admiring the misty mountain views. My stay there was amazing—the atmosphere, the hospitality, and especially the delicious, fresh food made my experience even more special.\n\nJoin me as I take you through this incredible journey, sharing the beauty of Chimbuk Pahar and my unforgettable experience. Don’t forget to like, comment, and subscribe to HM Vlogs UAE for more exciting travel content!\n\nEnjoy the video!\n\n\n#Bandarban #ChimbukPahar #ChimbukHill #ChimbukMountain #VisitBangladesh #ExploreBandarban #BeautifulBangladesh #HillTribeBangladesh #BangladeshTourism #TravelBangladesh #MountainView #NatureLover #CloudyMountains #TravelVlog #BangladeshVlogger #NaturePhotography #ScenicView #HillStation #SunriseView #M